<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Caregiver Sanctuary Community Series &mdash; Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<meta name="description" content="A rotating series of caregiver gatherings and wellness experiences across the Milwaukee community, hosted by Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'community-series' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero" style="padding: 56px 0 64px;">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#eeddd2;"><a href="programs-events.html" style="color:#eeddd2;">Programs &amp; Events</a></p>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);">Caregiver Sanctuary Community Series</h1>
    <p class="lede">A rotating series of gatherings and wellness experiences for caregivers, hosted around the community &mdash; somewhere to go that is just for you.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="#upcoming" class="btn btn-coral">See what's coming up</a>
      <a href="request-support.html" class="btn btn-outline-light">Ask us a question</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>What the series is</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 640px;">Caring for someone with dementia narrows your world fast. The Community Series
      exists to widen it again for a few hours at a time &mdash; a gathering, a wellness session, a
      conversation with people who understand the day you have just had.</p>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 640px;">Sessions move around the community rather than sitting in one building, so there is
      usually something within reach. You do not need to be enrolled in any Legacy programme to come.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="upcoming" style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Dates</span><h2>Upcoming sessions</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 640px;">The schedule for the coming season is being finalised. Once dates are set they will
      be listed here, each with its own registration link.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Schedule coming</span>
    <p class="mt-24"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="programs-events.html#calendar">See the full events calendar</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="register">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Registering for a session</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 640px;">Sessions have limited places, so each one takes registration in advance. When a
      session opens, its registration link appears beside the date above.</p>
    {#
      Registration runs through GiveButter, which Legacy already uses for donations and which
      supports event pages and ticketing. That keeps this inside the systems the engagement
      already covers rather than introducing a new one. The link below stays a placeholder until
      Legacy creates the first event and sends the URL - do not invent a GiveButter URL.
    #}
    <span class="badge-phase2">Registration links coming</span>
    <p class="muted mt-24" style="max-width: 640px;">Cannot find a session that works, or need something to be accessible in a
      particular way? <a href="request-support.html">Tell us</a> and we will help.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>More from Legacy</h2></div>
    <div class="card-grid mt-24">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Drop-In Respite</h3>
        <p>Time to breathe while your loved one is somewhere safe, engaged and cared for.</p>
        <a class="more" href="programs-events.html#drop-in">About Drop-In Respite &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Virtual Support Group</h3>
        <p>A regular group you can join from home, no travel needed.</p>
        <a class="more" href="programs-events.html#support-group">Join the group &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>The Caregiver Sanctuary Network</h3>
        <p>Dementia-friendly businesses and partners across the community.</p>
        <a class="more" href="sanctuary.html">About the Network &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
